    "title": "From the editor: They want Black culture, but not Black votes - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Adrienne Johnson Martin ,\n17 hours ago I’ve been thinking about that saying since last week, when Memphis was divided by three and Memphians’ voting power was diluted. If you’re not familiar, the phrase points to the embrace of Black cultural contributions, while at the same time rejecting the pain and inequality of Black lives that have often led to the creation of the music, the fashion and the language. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 7",
